    "description": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This corner-positioned 3 person hybrid sauna is a wonderful addition to any suitable location. As a hybrid sauna, it makes full use of both types of heaters to provide a wholesome sauna experience. Up to four people at a time can use this sauna comfortably.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The use of Harvia electric heaters and infra-red lamps also specifically designed for sauna comfort in mind, makes those much-needed sweat sessions much more convenient for regular use. Comfort in addition to style makes you want to spend a lot of time inside this sauna.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The materials used in the construction of this sauna are well-adapted for outdoors, meaning that the sauna is reliable and durable. It is also very space-efficient as it occupies a corner. As an outdoor sauna, it is well-protected against the wind and the rain which would damage most other saunas of other brands.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>Diamond</span>&nbsp;line of saunas utilizes glass panels to bring a feeling of spaciousness and to allow more light in from the outside. From the outside, this sauna looks beautiful as it is made of Canadian natural cedar wood and it is therefore a great option for those looking for authenticity.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Canadian natural red cedar wood is a renewable resource that comes from forests that are well looked after. The material itself is well-known in the construction industry for its resilience, hardness, and luxuriousness.</span></p>",
